# An unnamed field of the arguments Structure past the last place of the data is not a formal of this subset: the launch
# is refused with 5 before any effect. Answer 3 is for a named field that names no formal only (the decision of Sol
# 2026-11-25, CODER-SMALLFIX-20261125-01). Nothing of the body or of the right sides after the refusal runs: AFTER
# equals BEFORE.
@: Args (7 8)
@: D (int: seen 0)
@: Code (
    seen := 1
)
int: before 0
int: after 0
before := 1
call(Args D Code)
after := 2
